data: {"type": "node_finish", "node": "analyst_p1", "data": {"accumulated_data": [{"subtask": "Truy v\u1ea5n ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh trung b\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng m\u00e1y m\u00f3c hi\u1ec7n c\u00f3.", "raw_data": "[{\"metric_name\": \"System-wide Average Stability\", \"average_stability_value\": 1.35}]", "mini_analysis": "Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh trung b\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng m\u00e1y m\u00f3c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1t **1.35**. D\u1ef1a tr\u00ean bi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ed3 Gauge, gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb n\u00e0y n\u1eb1m trong v\u00f9ng xanh (ng\u01b0\u1ee1ng t\u1eeb 1.215 tr\u1edf l\u00ean), cho th\u1ea5y h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng \u0111ang v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh cao. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00edn hi\u1ec7u t\u00edch c\u1ef1c, kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh chung c\u1ee7a thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u0111ang n\u1eb1m trong ng\u01b0\u1ee1ng an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u."}, {"subtask": "Truy v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 so s\u00e1nh \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng m\u00e1y \u0111\u01a1n l\u1ebb trong h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng.", "raw_data": "[{\"device_name\": \"LG gram 16 (2025)\", \"brand\": \"lg\", \"processor\": \"Intel Core Ultra 5 226V\", \"graphics_card\": \"Intel Arc Graphics 130V\", \"stability_score\": null, \"office_battery_life\": 0.0, \"gaming_battery_life\": 0.0, \"mobility_rating\": 0.0}, {\"device_name\": \"ASUS Vivobook S14 OLED M5406KA-PP134WS\", \"brand\": \"asus\", \"processor\": \"AMD Ryzen AI 7 350\", \"graphics_card\": \"AMD Radeon 860M\", \"stability_score\": null, \"office_battery_life\": 0.0, \"gaming_battery_life\": 0.0, \"mobility_rating\": 0.0}, {\"device_name\": \"Expertbook P5\", \"brand\": \"asus\", \"processor\": \"Intel Core Ultra 7 258V\", \"graphics_card\": \"Intel Arc Graphics 140V (t\u00edch h\u1ee3p)\", \"stability_score\": null, \"office_ba